_bird.jpg/500px-Lyre_bird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Lyre_bird.jpg/1280px-Lyre_bird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Lyre_bird.jpg/500px-Lyre_bird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"John Gould's early 1800s painting of a superb lyrebird specimen at the British Museum","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALyre_bird.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Australia-Stamp-1932-Lyrebird.jpg/120px-Australia-Stamp-1932-Lyrebird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/Australia-Stamp-1932-Lyrebird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Australia-Stamp-1932-Lyrebird.jpg/120px-Australia-Stamp-1932-Lyrebird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Superb lyrebird on a 1932 Australian postage stamp","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAustralia-Stamp-1932-Lyrebird.jpg"}],"sounds":{"lyrebird":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-lyrebird.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-lyrebird.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-lyrebird.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-lyrebird.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-lyrebird.wav.ogg"}]}}}